// Spellbook.rdm — random D&D spellbooks & scrolls, SRD 5.2 only
// =====================================================================
// Contributed by Brinx-git (github.com/Obsidian-TTRPG-Community/
// Randomness issue #7). Spell names are from Wizards of the Coast's
// System Reference Document 5.2 (CC-BY-4.0) — see ATTRIBUTION.md.
//
// Entry tables (weighted toward the levels each book/scroll favours):
//   [@Spellbook]        wizard spell, full level spread (1–9)
//   [@Lowspellbook]     wizard spell, levels 1–5
//   [@Highspellbook]    wizard spell, levels 5–9
//   [@Clericscroll]  [@LowClericscroll]  [@HighClericscroll]
//   [@Bardscroll]    [@LowBardscroll]    [@HighBardscroll]
//   [@Druidscroll]   [@LowDruidscroll]   [@HighDruidscroll]
//
// Each result is prefixed with its level ("3 - Fireball",
// "C5 - Flame Strike") so a rolled book reads at a glance.
//
// An 8-spell wizard spellbook, no duplicate spells, alphabetized:
//   `rdm:[!8 Spellbook >> sort >> implode \n]`
// One high-level druid scroll:
//   `rdm:[@HighDruidscroll]`
// =====================================================================

